<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Xiang jun</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The xiang jun was the professional standing army of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/song-dynasty">Song Dynasty</a>. The Song Dynasty profile notes that it was very large, with estimates of over one million men under arms at its peak. However, it was notoriously ill-disciplined, under-equipped and led by civil officials, reflecting the Song priority of civilian control over military power.</p></div>
